---
description: Prepare one coordinateLiveChange evidence slice.
args: { goal: string; records: EventRunPlan[]; evidence: EvidenceItem[] }
returns: EvidenceSlice
---
Select a bounded evidence slice for the exact subject and task. Include supporting and contradictory versions, authority, and freshness. Record searched scope and missing decisive facts. Apply this stage's relevance rule: Obtain producer approval, issue role-specific updates, and confirm that critical staff received the same revision. Track actual execution and adapt only affected elements as new events arrive, preserving an authoritative current run plan. Return source item IDs and evidence, not conclusions or a corpus-wide paraphrase.
